From 8d58a86237f061e86490151362369977a3598fbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:21:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 217/248] fix(kanban): gateway failure notices share the
 classifier; retry/refusal claims only when recorded [daveey]

Messaging-gateway gave_up/crashed/timed_out now use describe_failure; retry is promised only
when retry_status is ready/review; removed the unsupported 'no alternate provider' claim;
terminal_provider no longer names a credential.
